# ── Stale desktop build directories — never commit ─────────────────────────
# desktop/ and desktop-native/ are superseded: the live Rust shell is
# brain/linux/centurion-desktop/ and the old Tauri app is archived under
# archive/desktop-tauri/. Both directories held nothing but cargo build output.
# An accidental `git add -A` swept 4,086 files / ~4GB into history once and
# blocked the push to GitHub on the 100MB blob limit. Ignored wholesale so it
# cannot recur. Nothing tracked lives under either path; both are safe to
# delete from disk.
desktop/
desktop-native/
